## Notes: |cFF33CCFFShows the location of all Trove of the Thunder King treasures on Thunder Island.|r
## Notes-deDE: |cFF33CCFFZeigt alle Fundorte der Schatztruhen des Donnerkönigs auf der Insel des Donnerkönigs an.|r
## Notes-esES: |cFF33CCFFMuestra la ubicación de todos los Tesoro del Rey del Trueno en la Isla del Trueno.|r
## Notes-esMX: |cFF33CCFFMuestra la ubicación de todos los Tesoro del Rey del Trueno en la Isla del Trueno.|r
## Notes-frFR: |cFF33CCFFAffiche l’emplacement de tous les Trésors du Roi Tonnerre sur l’Île du Roi Tonnerre.|r
## Notes-itIT: |cFF33CCFFMostra la posizione di tutti i Tesori del Re del Tuono sull’Isola del Re del Tuono.|r
## Notes-koKR: |cFF33CCFF번개왕의 섬에 있는 모든 번개의 왕 보물 위치를 표시합니다.|r
## Notes-ptBR: |cFF33CCFFMostra a localização de todos os Tesouros do Rei do Trovão na Ilha do Rei do Trovão.|r
## Notes-ruRU: |cFF33CCFFПоказывает все местоположения Сокровищ Короля Грома на Острове Короля Грома.|r
## Notes-zhCN: |cFF33CCFF显示雷王宝藏在雷王岛上的所有位置。|r
## Notes-zhTW: |cFF33CCFF顯示雷王寶藏在雷王島上的所有位置。|r
## Notes-plPL: |cFF33CCFFPokazuje położenie wszystkich skarbów Trove of the Thunder King na Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-svSE: |cFF33CCFFVisar var alla Trove of the Thunder King-skatter finns på Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-noNO: |cFF33CCFFViser hvor alle Trove of the Thunder King-skattene er på Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-csCZ: |cFF33CCFFUkazuje polohu všech pokladů Trove of the Thunder King na Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-nlNL: |cFF33CCFFToont de locatie van alle Trove of the Thunder King-schatten op Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-roRO: |cFF33CCFFArată locația tuturor comorilor Trove of the Thunder King de pe Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-huHU: |cFF33CCFFMegmutatja az összes Trove of the Thunder King kincs helyét az Isle of Thunderen.|r
## Notes-elGR: |cFF33CCFFΔείχνει τη θέση όλων των θησαυρών Trove of the Thunder King στο Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-ukUA: |cFF33CCFFПоказує розташування всіх скарбів Trove of the Thunder King на Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-daDK: |cFF33CCFFViser placeringen af alle Trove of the Thunder King-skatte på Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-fiFI: |cFF33CCFFNäyttää kaikkien Trove of the Thunder King -aarteiden sijainnin Isle of Thunderilla.|r
## Notes-skSK: |cFF33CCFFUkazuje polohu všetkých pokladov Trove of the Thunder King na Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-bgBG: |cFF33CCFFПоказва местоположението на всички съкровища Trove of the Thunder King на Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-hrHR: |cFF33CCFFPrikazuje lokaciju svih blaga Trove of the Thunder King na Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-srRS: |cFF33CCFFPrikazuje lokaciju svih blaga Trove of the Thunder King na Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-slSI: |cFF33CCFFPrikaže lokacijo vseh zakladov Trove of the Thunder King na Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-ltLT: |cFF33CCFFRodo visų Trove of the Thunder King lobių vietas Isle of Thunder saloje.|r
## Notes-lvLV: |cFF33CCFFParāda visu Trove of the Thunder King dārgumu atrašanās vietu Isle of Thunder salā.|r
## Notes-etEE: |cFF33CCFFNäitab kõigi Trove of the Thunder King aarete asukohta Isle of Thunderil.|r
## Notes-idID: |cFF33CCFFMenampilkan lokasi semua harta Trove of the Thunder King di Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-msMY: |cFF33CCFFMenunjukkan lokasi semua harta Trove of the Thunder King di Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-faIR: |cFF33CCFFمکان همه گنج‌های Trove of the Thunder King را در Isle of Thunder نشان می‌دهد.|r
## Notes-heIL: |cFF33CCFFמציג את המיקום של כל אוצרות Trove of the Thunder King ב-Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-bnBD: |cFF33CCFFIsle of Thunder-এ সব Trove of the Thunder King গুপ্তধনের অবস্থান দেখায়।|r
## Notes-urPK: |cFF33CCFFIsle of Thunder پر تمام Trove of the Thunder King خزانوں کا مقام دکھاتا ہے۔|r
## Notes-taIN: |cFF33CCFFIsle of Thunder இல் உள்ள அனைத்து Trove of the Thunder King புதையல்களின் இடத்தைக் காட்டுகிறது.|r
## Notes-teIN: |cFF33CCFFIsle of Thunder లోని అన్ని Trove of the Thunder King నిధుల స్థానాన్ని చూపిస్తుంది.|r
## Notes-trTR: |cFF33CCFFIsle of Thunder'daki tüm Trove of the Thunder King hazinelerinin yerini gösterir.|r
## Notes-jaJP: |cFF33CCFFIsle of Thunder にあるすべての Trove of the Thunder King の宝の場所を表示します。|r
## Notes-arSA: |cFF33CCFFيعرض مواقع جميع كنوز Trove of the Thunder King في Isle of Thunder.|r
## Notes-hiIN: |cFF33CCFFIsle of Thunder पर सभी Trove of the Thunder King ख़ज़ानों की जगह दिखाता है।|r
## Notes-thTH: |cFF33CCFFแสดงตำแหน่งสมบัติ Trove of the Thunder King ทั้งหมดบน Isle of Thunder|r
## Notes-viVN: |cFF33CCFFHiển thị vị trí của tất cả kho báu Trove of the Thunder King trên Isle of Thunder.|r

